:"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7D8RJH","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-13T01:41:26Z","updated_at":"2025-09-13T03:52:42Z","body":"I tested the mrp in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110474\r\nStruct key:\r\n```\r\nProject FPS: 98 (10.20 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 92 (10.86 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 93 (10.75 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 102 (9.80 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 93 (10.75 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 96 (10.41 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 97 (10.30 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 97 (10.30 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 94 (10.63 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 99 (10.10 mspf)\r\n```\r\nStringName key:\r\n```\r\nProject FPS: 106 (9.43 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 106 (9.43 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 113 (8.84 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 106 (9.43 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 111 (9.00 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 105 (9.52 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 103 (9.70 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 104 (9.61 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 109 (9.17 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 103 (9.70 mspf)\r\n```\r\nEdit: after optimizing by reference:\r\n```\r\nProject FPS: 125 (8.00 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 123 (8.13 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 124 (8.06 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 123 (8.13 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 124 (8.06 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 124 (8.06 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 124 (8.06 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 120 (8.33 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 116 (8.62 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 118 (8.47 mspf)\r\n```\r\n\r\nuint32_t key (master):\r\n```\r\nProject FPS: 128 (7.81 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 133 (7.51 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 137 (7.29 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 140 (7.14 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 137 (7.29 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 131 (7.63 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 133 (7.51 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 130 (7.69 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 131 (7.63 mspf)\r\nProject FPS: 135 (7.40 mspf)\r\n```\r\nUsing StringName is faster than struct, but is slower than original uint32_t key sadly.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3287355975/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":1,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3288717355","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110439#issuecomment-3288717355","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110439","id":3288717355,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7EBdgr","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-13T18:33:33Z","updated_at":"2025-09-13T18:33:33Z","body":"This PR currently looks to be prioritizing safety over performance by adopting StringName, sacrificing a little performance cost.\r\n\r\n> It should probably be done only once after the animation loads and all tracks have finished generating their hashes, rather than during hash generation. Using something like a hash_dirty flag for deferred calls might be a preferable approach.\r\n\r\nI'm also interested in how the approach I suggested above would fare. Then I think we'll compare the results and finally adopt whichever performs better.\r\n\r\nIf you could do it, we'd be happy to have your help. If you're not interested, I'll try it myself after I finish my other priority tasks.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3288717355/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3289354352","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110439#issuecomment-3289354352","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110439","id":3289354352,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7ED5Bw","user":{"login":"beicause","id":75941842,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc1OTQxODQy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/75941842?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause","html_url":"https://github.com/beicause","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/beicause/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-09-14T08:38:51Z","updated_at":"2025-09-14T08:38:51Z","body":"In fact, I also quickly tried using 64bit and 128bit (`FixedVector<uint64_t, 2>`) hash algorithms. The 64bit hash is as fast as the original 32bit (136 fps). 128bit is slightly faster than StringName (128 fps vs 122 fps).\r\n\r\n64bit hash would be much safer than 32bit, but it might not be sufficient to completely solve the problem ([The birthday bound of 32bit hash is just 77,000, while 64bit hash is 5.1×10^9, ](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Birthday_attack)but considering the number of Godot users, this doesn't guarantee it won't happen). For now I prefer StringName, we should not sacrifice security for this kind of optimization.\r\n\r\n>I think it would be comforting if we could check for collisions only once during hash generation and then increment the int as avoidance, but we should probably consider the performance cost of the collision check since it will likely require iterating over all hashes within the AnimationLibrary. It should probably be done only once after the animation loads and all tracks have finished generating their hashes, rather than during hash generation. Using something like a hash_dirty flag for deferred calls might be a preferable approach.\r\n\r\nThis method sounds complicated. I suspect the current approach might not be optimal. But I'm not familiar with the animation code, so I'm not sure and it's difficult for me to try other approaches.\r\n\r\nIf anyone have better ways, feel free to go ahead.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3289354352/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3507909906","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110439#issuecomment-3507909906","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/110439","id":3507909906,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc7RFnUS","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-11-09T10:25:08Z","updated_at":"2025-11-09T10:25:08Z","body":"Is the current status of this PR `Edit: after optimizing by reference:` in https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/110439#issuecomment-3287355975?\r\n","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/3507909906/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":